<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67920" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mixing, mingling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τε διάλλαξίς τε μιγέντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					8.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				47d
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				327a30
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					260b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάσας μ. μείγνυσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					620d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>intercourse</i> with others, esp. <i>sexual intercourse</i>
			or <i>commerce</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.203
			</span></i>, al.; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικῶν] ἐπίκοινον τὴν μ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.172
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνων πρὸς ἵππους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anacr.
					35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρρενος πρὸς ἄρρεν, θήλεος πρὸς θῆλυ
					μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.990d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν παίδων μ.</span>
			<i>union</i> for the sake of . . , <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				773d
			</span></i>. (In codd. sts. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῖξις</span>, for
			which <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεῖξις</span></b>  shd. prob. be
			restd. in Prose:—with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεῖξις</span>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίξις</span>, cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φεῦξις</span>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύξις</span>.)</div>
